      "q": "13. A rope of negligible mass is wound round a hollow cylinder of mass $ 3kg$ and radius $ 40cm$ . What is the angular acceleration of the cylinder if the rope is pulled with a force of $ 30N$ ? What is the linear acceleration of the rope? Assume that there is no slipping.",
