      "q": "16. An organ pipe ${{\\text{P}}_1}$ closed at one end vibrating in its first overtone and another pipe ${{\\text{P}}_2}$open at both the ends vibrating in its third overtone are in resonance with a given tuning fork. Find the ratio of length of ${{\\text{P}}_1}$ and ${{\\text{P}}_2}$ ?",
